**中文释义**：[医] 体被的, 皮肤的

temporo-auricular.display:
**英英释义**：a. Of or pertaining to both the temple and the ear;
   as, the temporo-auricular nerve.

**中文释义**：[医] 颞耳[部]的

thaumaturgical.display:
**英英释义**：a. Of or pertaining to thaumaturgy; magical;
   wonderful.

**中文释义**：a. 奇术的, 魔术的

torpent.display:
**英英释义**：a. Having no motion or activity; incapable of motion;
   benumbed; torpid.

**中文释义**：[医] 迟钝的, 不活泼的; 缓和剂, 保护剂

trichotomous.display:
**英英释义**：a. Divided into three parts, or into threes;
   three-forked; as, a trichotomous stem.

**中文释义**：[医] 三分的, 分三部的

